# Citation metadata, in the format GitHub and Zenodo both read.
#
# The same claim appears in three places: this file, the footer of the tool
# itself, and the manuscript's Availability section. Three copies of one string
# is three chances to disagree, so a test asserts this file against the values
# in src/lib/site.ts, and the remaining diff against the manuscript is done by
# hand because nothing here can see that document.
#
# The DOI is minted by Zenodo when the tagged release is archived. Two are
# recorded: the concept DOI, which always resolves to the newest version and is
# the one to cite, and the version DOI for this release. The concept DOI is held
# against CITATION_DOI in src/lib/site.ts by the same check that holds the
# version, so the footer and this file cannot drift apart.
#
# The version DOI is recorded after the release that mints it, because a
# release cannot contain its own identifier. Zenodo holds the full list of
# versions under the concept DOI; only the current one is repeated here.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Antigen Density Calculator
abstract: >-
  A deterministic browser tool that converts flow cytometry median fluorescence
  intensity into antibody binding capacity against a calibrated bead standard,
  reports the uncertainty of that conversion, and withholds a figure it cannot
  defend. All computation is ordinary least squares in log10-log10 space. No
  model, no imputation and no language model is applied to any reported value,
  and no data entered by a user leaves the browser.
authors:
  - family-names: Modi
    given-names: A.B.
    affiliation: Ligant AI Incorporated
# Matches APP_VERSION in src/lib/site.ts and the tag on the archived release.
# The leading v is kept so that this file, the footer and the tag are the same
# string rather than three conventions for one version.
version: v0.1.2
# The day the tag was cut, not the day this file was written. Those were four
# days apart, and a citation whose release date precedes the released commit is
# wrong in the direction that matters: it points a reader at a tree that did not
# yet exist.
date-released: '2026-09-02'
license: Apache-2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22259176
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22259176
    description: Concept DOI. Resolves to the newest archived version, and is the one to cite.
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22259811
    description: Version DOI for v0.1.2.
repository-code: https://github.com/abmodi-ai/Ligant.ai-Antigen-Density-Calculator
url: https://benchtools.ligant.ai
keywords:
  - flow cytometry
  - antigen density
  - antibody binding capacity
  - CAR T
  - cell therapy
  - calibration
  - reproducible research
